  "period_note": "Balance sheet is the period-end snapshot (reported), Solo basis, from First Security Islami Bank PLC's own Condensed Balance Sheet (Un-audited) as at 2023-06-30. Income-statement items with a '_cumulative' suffix are cumulative from 1 January of the same year; items with a '_discrete_q' suffix are the single discrete quarter alone -- both are printed directly as separate columns in the source document (not derived by subtraction), so both carry basis='reported'. The comparative prior-year-end Total Assets column in this filing cross-validates exactly (to the taka, after rounding) against this dataset's already-stored 615,487.79mn (2022_Q4.json) total_assets figure, confirming Solo basis continuity and no restatement between the audited annual figure and this interim filing's own comparative column. Cumulative (Jan-Jun) and discrete (Apr-Jun) columns both directly reported. Notably, cumulative Specific Provision for Classified Investment (Note 15(a)) was BDT -573.50mn for H1 2023 -- i.e. a NET RELEASE/reversal of provision, not a charge -- consistent with this being the calm period before the 2024 collapse (the bank's own FY2023 annual data, already in this dataset, shows Percentage of Classified Investments improving to 3.95% that year).",
